From 2b3581865c38d64c79f7f8649085ff3cf7849efd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Prakharrdev <prakhar06.work@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 15:15:36 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] Add WhatsApp as a messaging platform

A collaboration-bridge adapter on the WhatsApp Business Cloud API, using
the operator's own Meta app and phone number. Inbound arrives on the
connection's own webhook address, signed with the app secret and
deduplicated by wamid. Outbound goes through the Graph API (v26.0),
covering text split at 4096 characters, quoting for threads, native
media within WhatsApp's limits, and a reaction plus typing indicator
while an agent works.

What WhatsApp cannot do is declared on the adapter and in
docs/messaging-platforms/whatsapp.md: the 24-hour window (no
templates), no edits or deletes, 1:1 only, no channel creation and no
directory search.

Closes #789
